OL,3,GNEWSABurnham rejects calls for         
OL,4,Adevolution of powers in letter to Welsh
OL,5,AFM                                     
OL,7,FThe prime minister has rejected        
OL,8,Flong-standing calls from the first     
OL,9,Fminister of Wales for certain powers to
OL,10,Fbe transferred from Westminster to     
OL,11,FCardiff.                               
OL,13,FIn a letter to Rhun ap Iorwerth, Andy  
OL,14,FBurnham said he was "not persuaded" by 
OL,15,Fthe case to devolve responsibilities   
OL,16,Fover policing and justice, the Crown   
OL,17,FEstate and rail infrastructure to      
OL,18,FWales.                                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
