OL,3,GNEWSABurnham rejects calls for         
OL,4,Adevolution of powers in letter to Welsh
OL,5,AFM                                     
OL,7,FThe first minister accused the prime   
OL,8,Fminister of "turning his back on       
OL,9,Fdevolution" and not viewing Wales as an
OL,10,F"equal nation".                        
OL,12,FBurnham's position is also at odds with
OL,13,FWelsh Labour leader Ken Skates who     
OL,14,Freiterated his position at a party     
OL,15,Fconference last weekend that policing  
OL,16,Fand the Crown Estate should be         
OL,17,Fdevolved.                              
